{"about_the_game":"<img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3783540/extras/clip_voden_play_01.gif?t=1750424271\" /><br><i>Voden's Job</i> is a small <strong>roguelike deckbuilding game</strong> where you have 7 rounds of experiments to collect enough DNA to evolve your specimen. Between each experiment, you can <strong>upgrade</strong> your deck with new cards, combos, and strange tools. The catch? Upgrading costs DNA, so you'll need to <strong>carefully balance</strong> how much you're willing to spend each round.<br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3783540/extras/clip_voden_shop_01.gif?t=1750424271\" /><br>The <strong>rules</strong> are <strong>simple</strong>: each experiment round is about playing Mutation cards until you run out of options. Mutation cards have a cost, paid with Eye cards, and each one has a different effect, like drawing more cards or gaining DNA. A Mutation is too <strong>weak</strong>? Just throw in some Enzyme cards to unleash <strong>powerful combos</strong>.<br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3783540/extras/clip_voden_tool_01.gif?t=1750424271\" /><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> 37 unique cards, including Mutation, Eye, and Enzyme types<br></li><li> 5 powerful tools to amplify card effects and tilt the odds in your favor<br></li><li> Fast-paced, streamlined gameplay<br></li><li> Endless replayability: each round is different<br></li><li> Atmospheric soundtrack mixed with splatter-style sound design<br></li><li> Rich pixel art visuals with plenty of juicy effects</li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3783540?t=1750424271","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3783540/d90f3e399e7b1e9e1803afa48b8aad7fd06b9bef/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=175042